abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a proposed inline HTML binding
  (<meta name="content-usage">) for the IETF AIPREF per-purpose
  AI usage preference vocabulary (train-ai, ai-use, search).
  Includes a dependency-free RFC 9651 dictionary parser with
  71 conformance vectors, a WHATWG-based reference oracle with
  differential validation, a test corpus server with privacy-aware
  retrieval logging, and a retrieval analyzer. Companion resource
  for The Web Conference 2027 Resource Track submission.
